## Repo structure

```
appdaemon/                    # Dev environment (Python apps)
├── appdaemon.yaml            # Local dev config (committed; never in image)
├── secrets.yaml              # Local dev secrets (.gitignored; never in image)
├── requirements.txt
└── apps/
    ├── apps-prod.yaml     # Production app list (all disable: true). Docker build strips disable and writes apps.yaml.
    ├── apps-dev.yaml      # Dev-only app list (keys end in _dev). Never in image.
    └── ...

docker/                       # Docker build files
├── Dockerfile
├── entrypoint.sh
├── process-apps-yaml.py
└── requirements-prod.txt

automations/                  # HA automations (YAML)
scripts/                      # HA scripts (YAML)
cards/                        # Dashboard cards (YAML)
helpers/                      # Example helper configs (reference only)
```

